1
00:00:06,780 --> 00:00:12,060
=Fatal Proximity to Him=

2
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:14,020
=Episode 22=

3
00:00:22,180 --> 00:00:23,340
Your weight is too far back.

4
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:25,060
Keep your body upright.

5
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:27,620
Open your arms and legs
at the same time.

6
00:00:27,780 --> 00:00:30,100
And follow your hand with your eyes.

7
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:41,140
Got it?

8
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:43,980
Why...

9
00:00:44,460 --> 00:00:45,740
Why are you helping me?

10
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:49,700
Our lives

11
00:00:49,780 --> 00:00:51,380
shouldn't be all about
beating each other.

12
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:54,540
How boring would Swan Lake be

13
00:00:55,140 --> 00:00:56,020
with only one White Swan?

14
00:00:57,060 --> 00:00:57,620
Besides,

15
00:00:58,220 --> 00:01:00,140
a ballet company can have
more than one principal.

16
00:01:01,060 --> 00:01:02,620
We should stand onstage together

17
00:01:03,300 --> 00:01:04,700
under the same spotlight

18
00:01:05,220 --> 00:01:06,100
and share the applause.

19
00:01:10,060 --> 00:01:11,140
That move just now...

20
00:01:11,620 --> 00:01:12,580
Want to try it again?

21
00:01:17,820 --> 00:01:18,220
Yeah.

22
00:01:25,540 --> 00:01:26,220
Oh, stop it.

23
00:01:28,780 --> 00:01:29,940
That little punk He Lan

24
00:01:29,940 --> 00:01:31,900
really screwed Junsheng over.

25
00:01:32,020 --> 00:01:32,700
Now,

26
00:01:32,780 --> 00:01:33,980
every time I see him and his dad,

27
00:01:33,980 --> 00:01:34,660
I get annoyed.

28
00:01:34,820 --> 00:01:35,300
Just

29
00:01:35,340 --> 00:01:36,500
wait a little longer for me.

30
00:01:36,740 --> 00:01:37,940
Once I get the compensation money,

31
00:01:38,060 --> 00:01:40,020
I'll dump that old scumbag He Jianye.

32
00:01:40,020 --> 00:01:40,620
Then you and I

33
00:01:40,940 --> 00:01:42,340
can finally be together.

34
00:01:43,620 --> 00:01:44,380
Bet you missed me terribly.

35
00:01:48,140 --> 00:01:48,700
Jianye?

36
00:01:48,900 --> 00:01:50,060
What are you two doing here?

37
00:01:50,620 --> 00:01:52,220
I just asked him to help
move some things.

38
00:01:52,540 --> 00:01:53,780
There's really nothing between us.

39
00:01:55,020 --> 00:01:56,260
Do this problem again.

40
00:01:57,940 --> 00:02:00,820
Why do I have to learn math?

41
00:02:01,020 --> 00:02:03,220
Give me a break.

42
00:02:04,220 --> 00:02:05,340
Finish this problem,

43
00:02:05,340 --> 00:02:06,700
and I'll buy you
spicy numbing stir-fry pot.

44
00:02:13,460 --> 00:02:15,420
Why do I have to go to college?

45
00:02:15,780 --> 00:02:18,020
I can do what I want without a degree.

46
00:02:19,980 --> 00:02:21,420
The future will be different.

47
00:02:22,420 --> 00:02:24,540
Food can be delicious and healthy.

48
00:02:25,100 --> 00:02:26,540
You could major in nutrition.

49
00:02:27,380 --> 00:02:28,420
Wouldn't you love

50
00:02:28,500 --> 00:02:30,180
to eat delicious food every day

51
00:02:30,660 --> 00:02:31,780
without gaining weight?

52
00:03:04,160 --> 00:03:08,940
(Bucket List)

53
00:03:09,900 --> 00:03:13,340
(Ten Years Later)

54
00:04:04,540 --> 00:04:05,500
The show went great.

55
00:04:07,820 --> 00:04:08,420
Congratulations.

56
00:04:10,300 --> 00:04:10,860
Thanks.

57
00:04:12,060 --> 00:04:13,100
But why just one flower?

58
00:04:17,380 --> 00:04:18,740
Last time, I proposed at the hospital.

59
00:04:19,380 --> 00:04:20,660
I wasn't very prepared.

60
00:04:22,740 --> 00:04:23,900
This time, I want to do it properly.

61
00:04:35,700 --> 00:04:36,420
I, He Lan,

62
00:04:37,860 --> 00:04:39,060
in front of all our friends

63
00:04:39,540 --> 00:04:40,940
and colleagues,

64
00:04:43,420 --> 00:04:45,740
formally ask Miss Luo Xiyu to marry me.

65
00:04:50,480 --> 00:04:53,810
♪The traces you left on my heart remain♪

66
00:04:53,810 --> 00:04:55,660
♪No busy signal can drown them out♪

67
00:04:55,660 --> 00:04:56,260
Xiyu.

68
00:04:57,340 --> 00:05:01,820
♪No cold night wind can blow them away♪

69
00:05:01,820 --> 00:05:03,100
Will you marry me?

70
00:05:04,170 --> 00:05:07,140
♪Love gives us reckless courage♪

71
00:05:07,140 --> 00:05:08,220
Of course I will.

72
00:05:08,220 --> 00:05:10,417
♪I said goodbye to the carefree me♪

73
00:05:11,060 --> 00:05:15,720
♪Yet I keep looking back,
longing for the past♪

74
00:05:17,850 --> 00:05:21,050
♪I swallowed every lie♪

75
00:05:21,290 --> 00:05:24,680
♪And forgot how cold you became♪

76
00:05:24,680 --> 00:05:27,230
♪All my pain♪

77
00:05:27,740 --> 00:05:29,860
♪I buried it all deep inside♪

78
00:05:29,870 --> 00:05:31,940
♪Your greatest charm is all in my head♪

79
00:05:31,940 --> 00:05:33,640
♪It's all just my imagination♪

80
00:05:34,260 --> 00:05:35,140
You two are a perfect match!

81
00:05:35,740 --> 00:05:36,700
May you grow old together!

82
00:05:36,820 --> 00:05:37,820
May you have a baby soon!

83
00:05:37,980 --> 00:05:39,020
And stay together forever as one!

84
00:05:39,260 --> 00:05:41,860
Congratulations!

85
00:05:42,668 --> 00:05:43,520
♪Completely♪

86
00:05:43,520 --> 00:05:45,600
♪Your greatest magic is my weakness♪

87
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:47,370
♪I just can't control myself♪

88
00:05:47,380 --> 00:05:49,050
♪That's why I keep falling♪

89
00:05:49,820 --> 00:05:50,780
Well, well.

90
00:05:51,500 --> 00:05:53,420
So you've all been in on this, huh?

91
00:05:53,460 --> 00:05:55,100
It was all his idea!

92
00:05:56,620 --> 00:05:57,140
Yep.

93
00:05:57,700 --> 00:05:58,740
It was all my idea.

94
00:05:59,060 --> 00:05:59,780
Kiss!

95
00:05:59,940 --> 00:06:00,700
Kiss!

96
00:06:00,740 --> 00:06:01,420
Kiss!

97
00:06:01,540 --> 00:06:02,340
Kiss!

98
00:06:02,500 --> 00:06:03,300
Kiss!

99
00:06:03,460 --> 00:06:04,260
Kiss!

100
00:06:04,420 --> 00:06:05,220
Kiss!

101
00:06:05,300 --> 00:06:06,100
Kiss!

102
00:06:06,140 --> 00:06:09,580
Kiss!

103
00:06:09,660 --> 00:06:10,460
Kiss!

104
00:06:10,500 --> 00:06:11,300
Kiss!

105
00:06:11,340 --> 00:06:12,140
Kiss!

106
00:06:12,260 --> 00:06:13,060
Kiss!

107
00:06:13,180 --> 00:06:13,980
Kiss!

108
00:06:19,220 --> 00:06:20,820
(In all the previous loops,)

109
00:06:21,300 --> 00:06:23,060
(I wore this ring for years.)

110
00:06:24,100 --> 00:06:24,940
(But this time,)

111
00:06:25,380 --> 00:06:27,180
(it finally feels like I belong.)

112
00:06:28,180 --> 00:06:29,860
(It feels like I'm really
going to marry He Lan)

113
00:06:30,220 --> 00:06:31,460
(and become his wife.)

114
00:06:47,460 --> 00:06:49,220
Where did you get this kite?

115
00:06:50,460 --> 00:06:51,860
All it took was a little effort.

116
00:06:52,340 --> 00:06:52,860
Well?

117
00:06:53,420 --> 00:06:54,260
I'm pretty good at this, right?

118
00:07:24,740 --> 00:07:27,340
Maybe swans were never meant
to stay on land forever.

119
00:07:39,580 --> 00:07:40,740
It's time to let go.

120
00:07:43,820 --> 00:07:45,980
It must hurt, carrying all of this
for me.

121
00:07:54,020 --> 00:07:55,140
Don't think like that.

122
00:07:57,500 --> 00:07:58,860
As long as I make a wish,

123
00:07:59,380 --> 00:08:00,660
we can start another loop.

124
00:08:02,580 --> 00:08:03,780
Then I can see you again.

125
00:08:04,260 --> 00:08:05,620
Have you been getting nosebleeds lately?

126
00:08:08,300 --> 00:08:09,580
It's probably just some inflammation.

127
00:08:09,580 --> 00:08:11,100
You know perfectly well that
if this keeps up,

128
00:08:11,100 --> 00:08:13,020
you'll disappear from this world.

129
00:08:16,060 --> 00:08:16,620
He Lan...

130
00:08:21,100 --> 00:08:22,580
Did you know

131
00:08:22,660 --> 00:08:23,860
every time you died,

132
00:08:26,060 --> 00:08:27,980
I kept living in that timeline?

133
00:08:29,660 --> 00:08:31,740
You mean you kept looping in
another spacetime loop,

134
00:08:32,460 --> 00:08:34,020
and started a new one?

135
00:08:35,540 --> 00:08:35,980
Yes.

136
00:08:37,620 --> 00:08:39,540
I remember every single timeline now.

137
00:08:41,700 --> 00:08:43,380
But I wasn't happy in any of them.

138
00:08:45,020 --> 00:08:46,860
Every day, I had to live with

139
00:08:47,180 --> 00:08:48,620
the pain of losing the person
I loved most.

140
00:08:53,980 --> 00:08:54,940
He Lan, I know...

141
00:08:56,900 --> 00:08:58,100
you can't bear to let me die.

142
00:08:59,980 --> 00:09:01,620
But everything you're trying to avoid

143
00:09:01,620 --> 00:09:04,020
is exactly what every version of me
is going through.

144
00:09:06,860 --> 00:09:08,780
Can you really make me keep reliving it?

145
00:09:16,100 --> 00:09:16,660
He Lan,

146
00:09:17,340 --> 00:09:18,140
I'm grateful to you

147
00:09:18,140 --> 00:09:20,060
for giving me so many cycles
to live through,

148
00:09:21,140 --> 00:09:22,660
and so many years of youth.

149
00:09:25,300 --> 00:09:27,060
Most people only get one short youth.

150
00:09:28,500 --> 00:09:30,700
But I remember everything

151
00:09:30,700 --> 00:09:31,820
from eighteen to twenty-eight.

152
00:09:35,260 --> 00:09:36,580
I've already been incredibly lucky.

153
00:09:43,420 --> 00:09:44,420
Come to think of it...

154
00:09:44,420 --> 00:09:47,460
♪I hide my racing heart without a sound♪

155
00:09:47,460 --> 00:09:49,020
If I add up all those timelines,

156
00:09:49,020 --> 00:09:50,420
it's been about a hundred years.

157
00:09:50,420 --> 00:09:52,460
♪I close my eyes and pretend
the story's been reset♪

158
00:09:52,460 --> 00:09:53,740
How is that not a lifetime?

159
00:09:55,980 --> 00:09:58,560
♪I steer clear of every path
that leads to you♪

160
00:09:59,460 --> 00:10:00,260
So...

161
00:10:02,380 --> 00:10:04,620
♪I thought if I didn't hear, see,
or speak of you♪

162
00:10:04,620 --> 00:10:08,100
♪I could cut every thread
that ties us together♪

163
00:10:09,540 --> 00:10:10,500
It's time to let go.

164
00:10:10,500 --> 00:10:14,468
♪Through the endless night,
I guard my only secret♪

165
00:10:15,970 --> 00:10:21,050
♪In this new cycle, I watch you
become innocent again♪

166
00:10:22,180 --> 00:10:24,310
♪I tried to erase the fire we once had♪

167
00:10:24,310 --> 00:10:28,060
♪But I can't erase your name
carved into my bones♪

168
00:10:28,820 --> 00:10:31,000
♪The more I try to leave you behind♪

169
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:35,260
♪The deeper I sink with no end in sight♪

170
00:10:35,260 --> 00:10:37,790
♪What if I stayed a little farther away♪

171
00:10:37,790 --> 00:10:41,460
♪Could I finally break free
from this cycle♪

172
00:10:41,930 --> 00:10:43,810
♪What if I took things a little slower♪

173
00:10:43,810 --> 00:10:48,040
♪Could I delay the moment
everything falls apart♪

174
00:10:48,040 --> 00:10:51,840
♪Maybe if I retreat to the edge
of my dreams♪

175
00:10:51,840 --> 00:10:54,850
♪I could give you another future♪

176
00:10:55,170 --> 00:11:01,400
♪A tomorrow where I no longer exist♪

177
00:11:01,400 --> 00:11:03,670
♪Even if I never want to see you again♪

178
00:11:03,670 --> 00:11:05,310
♪This nightmare still won't end♪

179
00:11:05,310 --> 00:11:07,170
♪Even if it all plays out again♪

180
00:11:07,170 --> 00:11:09,360
♪I'll still find my way back to you♪

181
00:11:09,360 --> 00:11:13,260
♪Even if having you only leaves me
in your debt♪

182
00:11:13,260 --> 00:11:17,250
♪It's still better than
losing you forever♪

183
00:11:21,100 --> 00:11:27,380
♪I don't want an eternity without you♪

184
00:11:27,380 --> 00:11:30,430
♪Even if holding on is more dangerous♪

185
00:11:30,430 --> 00:11:32,030
♪More dangerous than letting go♪

186
00:11:32,030 --> 00:11:35,310
♪At least we were real in this moment♪

187
00:11:35,310 --> 00:11:38,840
♪At least none of this was pretend♪

188
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:41,000
♪In every life where I have you♪

189
00:11:41,010 --> 00:11:46,770
♪I choose you in every lifetime
and every day♪

190
00:11:46,770 --> 00:11:48,640
♪What if I stayed a little farther away♪

191
00:11:48,650 --> 00:11:50,720
♪Is nothing but a poor attempt
to fool myself♪

192
00:11:50,720 --> 00:11:52,700
♪If I could really stay away♪

193
00:11:52,710 --> 00:11:54,520
♪Then this wouldn't be longing♪

194
00:11:54,530 --> 00:11:56,760
♪If every time I wake up♪

195
00:11:56,770 --> 00:11:59,580
♪I still end up falling for you♪

196
00:11:59,580 --> 00:12:05,940
♪Then let me fall♪

197
00:12:05,940 --> 00:12:09,350
♪Fall all over again♪

198
00:12:09,350 --> 00:12:13,540
♪Fall♪

199
00:12:15,410 --> 00:12:17,460
♪Don't hold back for tomorrow♪

200
00:12:18,900 --> 00:12:20,730
♪Don't cut this moment short♪

201
00:12:21,500 --> 00:12:23,520
♪I'll always recognize your face♪

202
00:12:23,940 --> 00:12:27,560
♪Let's make this moment last♪

203
00:12:27,570 --> 00:12:29,468
♪Take it all the way♪

204
00:12:29,470 --> 00:12:36,390
♪Take it all the way♪

205
00:12:36,390 --> 00:12:42,260
♪Take it all the way♪
